OL,3,GNEWSAOverturned lorry causes delays on
OL,4,AA1(M)
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing delays on the A1(M)
OL,7,Fdue to an overturned lorry.
OL,9,FAll lanes were closed between junctions
OL,10,F60 and 61, at Bowburn, south of Durham,
OL,11,Fafter the Warburtons HGV overturned,
OL,12,Fflattened the central reservation
OL,13,Fbarrier and "shed its load" across both
OL,14,Fcarriageways at about 05:14 GMT, Durham
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe force said the driver of the lorry
OL,18,Fwas taken to hospital, while a full
OL,19,Fclosure of the northbound carriageway
OL,20,Fbetween Bowburn and Carville
OL,21,FInterchange remains.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
